      "message": "Good point. I think this is at least inconsistent, since we don\u0027t really reuse guest EPT as IOMMU page tables, we only do that with the host EPT.\n\nThe existing pkVM-IA code (shadow EPT) has the same inconsistency. But perhaps it\u0027s a good moment to clean this up a bit, e.g. by directly setting `level` and `allowed_pgsz` here, independently of `pkvm_hyp-\u003eept_cap`.",
