      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: Just want to share some related v6.15 rebasing for adding isolation. The finalize will map host EPT with RWX + WB for memory and RWX + UC for MMIO. To make the finalize independent with the EPT (property bits format), I introduced a new callback in the pkvm_pgtable_ops, to calculate the property bits according various combinations of the bool read, bool write, bool exec and enum page_cache_mode.",
